      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيْرٌ</span></b>  The <i>membrum virile; penis; veretrum:</i>
(TA:) pl. [of pauc.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آيُرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آيَارٌ</span> (S, M, K) and
